# This file describes v0.2.1. v0.2.1 ships byte-identical node/edge data to v0.2.0 -- it exists
# solely to correct the v0.2.0 dataset card (an internal/contractual content leak, wrong license
# text, a stale "zenodo.TBD" citation placeholder, and a false betweenness-score claim; see
# lunasai-knowledge-graph's modules/export/release.py fix commit for the full list). The Zenodo
# draft for v0.2.1 (10.5281/zenodo.24108692, same concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24011484 as v0.1.0/
# v0.2.0) was staged by this pass but had not yet been published by the owner as of this commit --
# the DOI below is real (Zenodo pre-reserves a version DOI the moment a new-version draft is
# created) and not a placeholder, but confirm https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24108692 resolves
# before relying on it if you're reading this very soon after the commit date below.
